JUS ET NORM A LOQUENDI. 401
wtu	16363	running_head	4-02 WORDS AND THEIR USES.
wtu	16371	junk	ders (A.D. 1616);

With Cockney gourmands great's the difference whether
wtu	2509	body_after_note_KEPT	At home they stay or forth to Paris go;
wtu	2509	verse	At home they stay or forth to Paris go;
wtu	2510	verse	For as they linger here or wander thither,
wtu	2511	verse	The flesh of calves to them is weal or watt.
